# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — REGULAFLOW AI
## SIH26262: AI-Powered AICTE Approval Workflow Automation & Compliance Monitoring Platform

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, UI/UX designer, AI engineer, database architect, and DevOps engineer. Build a complete, functional, production-minded web application named **RegulaFlow AI**.

Do not build merely a landing page, static dashboard, or UI prototype. Build an integrated application with working navigation, authentication, forms, API calls, database persistence, role-based access, workflow management, analytics, and AI-assisted features.

